 "narrative": "## The trajectory\nRevenue was $67.6B in FY2025 [1].\nRevenue CAGR was +6.4% over FY2016..FY2025 [2].\nNet income was USD 8,884,000,000 in FY2025 [3].\n\n## Growth quality\nRevenue growth in FY2025 was +4.3% [1] [4].\nNet income growth in FY2025 was -17.7% [3] [5].\nIn FY2025, net income growth of -17.7% [3] [5] was below revenue growth of +4.3% [1] [4].\n\n## Margins\nOperating margin was 16.5% in FY2025 [6].\nOperating margin changed -3.7pp in FY2025 [6] [7].\nNet margin changed -3.5pp in FY2025 [8] [9].\n\n## Cash & balance sheet\nIn FY2025, free cash flow of USD 8,918,000,000 [10] was above net income of USD 8,884,000,000 [3].\nThe current ratio was 1.44\u00d7 in FY2025 [11], above 1.00\u00d7.\nIn FY2025, operating cash flow of $11.7B [12] was above net income of USD 8,884,000,000 [3].\n\n## Red flags\nNo trend flags detected in the selected data.\n\n## What to watch next\nWatch whether revenue growth in the next reporting update improves from +4.3% in FY2025 [1] [4].\nWatch how net income in the next reporting update compares with USD 8,884,000,000 in FY2025 [3].\nWatch how operating margin in the next reporting update compares with 16.5% in FY2025 [6].",
